        "title: \"Cholesky Decomposition\"\n",
        "subtitle: \"Appendix\"\n",
        "description: \"This appendix explains the Cholesky decomposition, which is a method for solving linear equations efficiently using linear algebra.\"\n",
        "categories: \n",
        "    - \"numerical linear algebra\"\n",
        "keywords: \n",
        "    - \"Moore-Penrose inversion\"\n",
        "    - \"Cholesky decomposition\"\n",
